{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p086b","title":"梁鹄窃取师宜官书札学书","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p086b-account","label":"卫恒《四体书势序》","text":"师宜官书后常毁札，梁鹄供书版并请其饮酒，趁醉取札，后来以书艺任选部尚书。","evidence":["wudi-e-p086b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0258","role":"学书受官","evidence":["wudi-e-p086b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0257","role":"书札被取","evidence":["wudi-e-p086b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"灵帝好书的叙事背景","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p086b-q"]},"source_order":[1,688,"P086b"],"order":281}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0257","name":"师宜官","evidence":["wudi-q-p086","wangwei-q-6c398c47ef99cdf68974"],"facts":[{"id":"wangwei-f-87a25dc235fcbf9b3966","text":"《四体书势》论其擅大字。","evidence":["wangwei-q-6c398c47ef99cdf68974"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-p086-wudi-p0257","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p086"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wangwei-q-6c398c47ef99cdf68974","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-cd77d33f69889e930350","layer":"pei","quote":"其序录隶书，已略见《武纪》，又曰：“师宜官为大字，邯郸淳为小字。梁鹄谓淳得次仲法，然鹄之用笔，尽其势矣。”","attribution":"裴注引卫恒《四体书势》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":415,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9886d275cee1012511a7","start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p086b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"至灵帝好书，世多能者，而师宜官为最。甚矜其能，每书，辄削焚其札。梁鹄乃益为版而饮之酒，候其醉而窃其札。鹄卒以攻书至选部尚书。","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":30,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p086","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞卫恒《四体书势序》曰：“上谷王次仲，善隶书，始为楷法。至灵帝好书，世多能者，而师宜官为最。甚矜其能，每书，辄削焚其札。梁鹄乃益为版而饮之酒，候其醉而窃其札。鹄卒以攻书至选部尚书。于是公欲为洛阳令，鹄以为北部尉。鹄后依刘表。及荆州平，公募求鹄；鹄惧，自缚诣门。署军假司马，使在秘书，以勤书自效。公常悬著帐中，及以钉壁玩之，谓胜宜官。鹄字孟黄，安定人。魏宫殿题署，皆鹄书也。”","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":0,"end":189,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
